            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis is certainly out of scope. It is both against [main goal of having single window design](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/73bbcbfa7839c4b00a64965fb504f87461abefbd/doc/mini-pick.txt#L10) and will disrupt [one of the advantages of 'mini.pick'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/73bbcbfa7839c4b00a64965fb504f87461abefbd/doc/mini-pick.txt#L208-L210).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
